{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495899,"name":"Carter Ventucci","username":"Carter-Ventucci","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/dec6dc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T19:15:20.781Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy Grok Bot account has been unusable since approximately September 7.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer is reachable and my existing bot roster and conversation history load, but every bot fails when I try to send a message. The problem occurs on both my Windows desktop and iPhone and affects every bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy original support case was T-F61261. The current support case is T-F65125.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn September 10, the automated support response said the issue had been passed to a teammate and that someone would follow up. No teammate has contacted me. I have followed up several times since then.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLater support/feedback tickets were closed as duplicates of T-F65125, so I do not want to create another support ticket. I am posting here because the existing case appears to be stuck in the automated support loop.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy account has active SuperGrok-linked Grok Bot access.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on desktop or iPhone.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen any existing bot or conversation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a message.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe bot fails to respond.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRepeat with another bot and the same failure occurs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer itself remains reachable and existing bots/history are visible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMessages sent to my Grok Bot agents should reach the existing Agent Computer/runtime and receive normal responses.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI would like the existing Agent Computer/runtime inspected and repaired or reattached on the backend without another Reset if possible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.11.1 (11669) ios\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditional context:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis issue has persisted for nearly two weeks and I have had no working Grok Bot agents during that time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport case T-F65125 is still the active case. I was told on September 10 that it had been passed to a teammate, but I have not received a follow-up from that teammate. Later support contacts were closed as duplicates of the same case.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA previous Reset/recovery attempt left the Agent Computer in a partial state, so I would prefer that the existing runtime/computer be inspected on the backend before another Reset is attempted.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am happy to provide the account email, exact error screenshots, request IDs, app/browser versions, or any other diagnostics privately if needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495899-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495899-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T19:15:30.424Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":10,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":51.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172368,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-unusable-since-sept-7-agent-computer-reachable-but-all-bots-fail-t-f65125","display_username":"Carter Ventucci","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138795,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-unusable-since-sept-7-agent-computer-reachable-but-all-bots-fail-t-f65125/172368/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":496223,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T08:35:57.238Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/carter-ventucci\"\u003e@Carter-Ventucci\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the detailed report, and sorry this has been dragging on since the 7th.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI looked into what’s happening on your account, and you understood it correctly. Your Agent Computer is still available, and your bots, files, and history are safe, but the connection is being routed to a runtime replica that stopped working on September 8. This is on our side, not something in your setup. That also explains the “partial state” after Reset, it was rejected on our side, so pressing it again won’t help.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis needs a backend cleanup on our side, not another Reset. I’ve passed everything to the team with full details so they can fix it without touching your data.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUntil the team replies here, please don’t press Reset, Recover, or Update, and don’t reinstall the app. Once we confirm the cleanup is done, fully close Grok Bot (right-click the tray icon and choose Quit on Windows, or swipe the app away on iPhone), reopen it, and send a quick “hello” to any bot.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-20T08:35:57.238Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":25.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":172368,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-unusable-since-sept-7-agent-computer-reachable-but-all-bots-fail-t-f65125","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-unusable-since-sept-7-agent-computer-reachable-but-all-bots-fail-t-f65125/172368/5","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":496433,"name":"Carter Ventucci","username":"Carter-Ventucci","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/dec6dc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T16:16:24.733Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Dean,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you. This is the first explanation I’ve received that identifies what is actually happening, and it makes sense based on the behaviour I’ve been seeing. Im s\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI appreciate you looking into the account directly and getting the details to the team. Please let me know once the cleanup has been completed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks,\u003cbr\u003e\nRyan\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-20T16:16:24.733Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":45.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172368,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-unusable-since-sept-7-agent-